<template>
<main class="medical-page agents-page">
 <p class="breadcrumb">管理 / Agent 与模型</p>
 <header class="page-heading"><div><h1>Agent 管理</h1><p>管理专业角色、模型连接、预算与固定版本，保留每次配置的真实依据。</p></div><el-button type="primary" :disabled="!user.medicalSession?.current_context" @click="openAuthor">新建 Agent / 能力</el-button></header>
 <session-panel/>
 <section class="card spaced"><h2>执行策略</h2><p>登记固定运行范围，核对真实角色和来源，由独立审批人批准。策略批准不会发布 Agent。</p><router-link to="/agents/execution-policies"><el-button type="primary">打开执行策略目录</el-button></router-link></section>
 <section class="card spaced"><h2>Agent 候选与工具草稿</h2><p>从真实固定依赖登记 Agent 候选、TOOL 和 SKILL，读取草稿与原操作回执。登记不会发布或执行。</p><router-link to="/agents/drafts"><el-button type="primary">打开候选与运行能力目录</el-button></router-link></section>
 <section class="card spaced"><h2>正式验收与发布</h2><p>核对固定评测、专家评分与独立验收，显式恢复原操作。缺少真实专业执行完成证明时，正式绑定、通过验收和发布保持阻断。</p><div class="actions"><router-link to="/agents/publication"><el-button type="primary">打开正式验收与发布</el-button></router-link><router-link to="/agents/context-bindings">正式评测上下文绑定</router-link></div></section>
 <section class="card spaced"><h2>正式能力草稿</h2><p>登记与核对 PRODUCTION 模式的角色或提示词声明。固定版本仍为 DRAFT，不授予发布或执行资格。</p><router-link to="/agents/capabilities"><el-button type="primary">打开正式能力目录</el-button></router-link></section>
 <section class="card spaced"><h2>运行记录保存策略</h2><p>查看保存期限与生效区间，明确新增、替换或停止使用策略。</p><router-link to="/agents/retention"><el-button>管理保存策略</el-button></router-link></section>
 <nav class="sections" aria-label="管理分区"><button :class="{active:section==='agents'}" @click="section='agents'">Agent 配置</button><button :class="{active:section==='models'}" @click="section='models'">模型 API</button></nav>
 <template v-if="section==='agents'">
 <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Agent 配置分区"><button v-for="item in tabs" :id="'agent-tab-'+item.id" :key="item.id" role="tab" :aria-selected="tab===item.id" :aria-controls="'agent-panel-'+item.id" :tabindex="tab===item.id?0:-1" @keydown="tabKey($event,item.id)" :class="{active:tab===item.id}" @click="tab=item.id">{{ item.label }}</button></div>
 <section :id="'agent-panel-'+tab" role="tabpanel" :aria-labelledby="'agent-tab-'+tab">
 <template v-if="tab==='defaults'">
 <div class="summary-grid"><section class="card"><div class="heading"><h2>Agent 版本</h2><el-tag type="info">当前授权范围</el-tag></div><p>以下为服务端配置目录元数据。目录中的状态不代表已满足生产发布条件。</p>
 <div class="actions"><el-button :loading="loading" :disabled="user.medicalWriting || !user.medicalSession?.current_context" @click="readList()">刷新版本</el-button><router-link to="/scenarios">查看业务场景</router-link></div>
 <el-alert v-if="error" type="error" :closable="false" :title="error"/>
 <el-table v-if="page" :data="page.items" row-key="version_id" aria-label="Agent 版本目录"><el-table-column label="名称与类别" min-width="180"><template #default="scope">{{ scope.row.name || '未命名配置' }}<small>配置定义待核验</small></template></el-table-column><el-table-column prop="configuration_revision" label="修订" width="80"/><el-table-column label="范围" min-width="100"><template #default="scope">{{ scope.row.project_id?'项目配置':'本企业' }}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column prop="status" label="登记状态" width="110"/><el-table-column label="固定版本" min-width="150"><template #default="scope"><el-button link @click="readFixed(scope.row.version_id)">读取草稿定义</el-button></template></el-table-column></el-table>
 <el-empty v-if="page?.items.length===0" description="当前授权范围没有 Agent 版本"/><p v-if="!page && !loading && !error">刷新后显示当前企业的真实配置记录。</p><el-button v-if="page?.next_after" :loading="loading" @click="readList(true)">下一页</el-button>
 </section><aside class="card"><h2>发布与调用检查</h2><ul class="checks"><li>用途、输入输出与规则版本<span>需逐项核验</span></li><li>模型连接与许可范围<span>需真实验证回执</span></li><li>企业授权与调用预算<span>需当前批准</span></li><li>真实样本评测与批准人<span>需有效评测记录</span></li></ul><p class="notice">模拟新建流程仅保存不可用于生产的草稿。正式候选须进入独立验收与发布流程。</p><router-link to="/evaluation">查看版本评测</router-link></aside></div>
 <section v-if="selected" class="card selected"><h2>{{ 'name' in selected.definition.request ? selected.definition.request.name : '固定能力版本' }}</h2><el-tag type="warning">DRAFT · SIMULATION</el-tag><dl><dt>固定版本</dt><dd>{{ selected.definition.version_id }}</dd><dt>创建时间</dt><dd>{{ selected.definition.created_at }}</dd><dt>生产资格</dt><dd>无；需另行完成生产配置、验证和审批</dd><dt>完整定义摘要</dt><dd>{{ selected.content_sha256 }}</dd></dl></section>
 </template>
 <template v-else-if="tab==='roles'"><section class="card"><h2>专业角色与交付职责</h2><p>角色通过真实来源成果、输入和输出契约登记。六类职责是配置说明，未登记为可运行角色。</p><div class="role-grid"><article v-for="role in roles" :key="role.name" class="role-card"><div class="heading"><h3>{{ role.name }}</h3><el-tag type="info">职责说明</el-tag></div><dl><dt>接收</dt><dd>{{ role.input }}</dd><dt>产出</dt><dd>{{ role.output }}</dd><dt>职责限制</dt><dd>{{ role.boundary }}</dd></dl></article></div><el-button @click="openAuthor">登记角色或提示词草稿</el-button></section></template>
 <section v-else-if="tab==='tools'" class="card"><h2>Skill 与工具</h2><el-table :data="[]" empty-text="当前未接入可核验的 Skill 与工具登记目录"><el-table-column label="名称与版本"/><el-table-column label="用途与来源"/><el-table-column label="动作与范围"/><el-table-column label="审核 / 连接状态"/></el-table><p class="notice">当前模拟能力草稿的工具范围固定为空。读取、生成草稿、导出与外部写入分别授权；本页不授予工具权限。</p></section>
 <section v-else-if="tab==='budget'" class="card"><h2>模型预算</h2><p>查看真实预算账户的批准依据、已用与预留额度，并在授权范围内创建或追加批准。</p><router-link to="/agents/budgets"><el-button type="primary">打开预算账户</el-button></router-link><p class="notice">模拟 Agent 的费用上限固定为 0。预算批准不会自动发布 Agent 或启动运行。</p></section>
 <section v-else-if="tab==='limits'" class="card"><h2>研究与修订上限</h2><p>新建模拟 Agent 时显式填写研究、修订、并行、请求、Token 与超时上限。</p><div v-if="selected && 'limits' in selected.definition.request" class="limits"><div v-for="(value,key) in selected.definition.request.limits" :key="key"><span>{{ limitNames[key] || key }}</span><strong>{{ value }}</strong></div></div><el-empty v-else description="请先在默认配置中读取固定 Agent 草稿"/><h3>停止条件</h3><ul><li>无新增有效证据时保留未解决问题，等待补证。</li><li>达到上限后停止新的派发，保留在途用量与恢复记录。</li><li>取消操作以运行服务的最终确认状态为准。</li></ul></section>
 <section v-else-if="tab==='evaluation'" class="card"><h2>评测与发布</h2><p>固定样本、评分、版本比较与评测记录在评测中心管理。</p><router-link to="/evaluation"><el-button type="primary">打开评测中心</el-button></router-link><div class="actions"><router-link to="/agents/simulation-preparation">准备模拟输入</router-link><router-link to="/agents/simulation-rules">模拟评分规则</router-link></div><el-alert class="spaced" type="warning" :closable="false" title="当前模拟草稿不具备生产资格" description="评测记录不等于发布批准。正式候选可在独立验收与发布页面核查，真实专业执行完成证明仍是必需前提。"/></section>
 <section v-else class="card"><h2>任务与调用记录</h2><p>从实际任务进入运行详情，核对固定版本、失败步骤、Token 用量与恢复结果。</p><router-link to="/tasks"><el-button type="primary">查看任务记录</el-button></router-link><p class="notice">当前没有按 Agent 汇总的调用目录接口，不用演示数据替代实际调用记录。</p></section>
 </section>
 </template>
 <section v-else class="card"><h2>模型 API 配置</h2><p>外部模型与本地模拟配置分开维护，草稿不代表已验证连接。</p><div class="role-grid"><article class="role-card"><h3>模型连接草稿</h3><router-link to="/agents/model-runtime">连接验证与启用资格</router-link><p>供应商、模型版本、政策、价格依据与调用限制。</p><router-link to="/model-configurations"><el-button type="primary">打开模型配置</el-button></router-link></article><article class="role-card"><h3>本地模拟模型</h3><p>固定模拟协议与用例绑定，不产生外部供应商费用。</p><router-link to="/simulation-model-configurations"><el-button>打开模拟模型配置</el-button></router-link></article></div></section>
 <configuration-authoring v-if="authorOpen" ref="author" class="spaced" @saved="saved"/>
</main>
</template>
<script setup lang="ts">
import { nextTick, onBeforeUnmount, ref, watch } from 'vue'
import useUserStore from '@/store/modules/user'
import SessionPanel from './session-panel.vue'
import ConfigurationAuthoring from './configuration-authoring.vue'
import { listScenarios } from '@/api/medical/scenarios'
import type { ScenarioPage } from '@/api/medical/scenarios'
import { readAuthored } from '@/api/medical/configuration-authoring'
import type { AuthorView } from '@/api/medical/configuration-authoring'
const user=useUserStore(),section=ref('agents'),tab=ref('defaults'),authorOpen=ref(false),author=ref<InstanceType<typeof ConfigurationAuthoring>|null>(null)
const page=ref<ScenarioPage|null>(null),selected=ref<AuthorView|null>(null),loading=ref(false),error=ref('')
const tabs=[{id:'defaults',label:'默认配置'},{id:'roles',label:'专业角色'},{id:'tools',label:'Skill 与工具'},{id:'budget',label:'模型预算'},{id:'limits',label:'研究上限'},{id:'evaluation',label:'评测发布'},{id:'records',label:'任务记录'}]
const roles=[{name:'任务规划',input:'目标、模板、资料清单与预算',output:'章节计划、研究问题、依赖与完成条件',boundary:'等待人工确认计划'},{name:'资料研究',input:'本次资料范围与研究问题',output:'原文位置、支持或冲突证据及缺项',boundary:'仅检索本次授权范围'},{name:'技术字段核验',input:'严格字段及指定权威资料',output:'原始取值、单位、条件与比对问题',boundary:'缺失字段等待补证'},{name:'章节撰写',input:'已确认计划、证据与上游章节',output:'章节候选正文、引用与未解决问题',boundary:'人工采纳后更新正文'},{name:'来源与规则审查',input:'候选正文、原始证据与规则',output:'引用错误、字段冲突与跨章问题',boundary:'保留独立审查职责'},{name:'总稿整理',input:'已核验章节与人工意见',output:'固定版本总稿、来源附录与成果清单',boundary:'签发状态由授权人员决定'}]
const limitNames:Record<string,string>={max_research_questions:'研究问题数',max_research_rounds:'研究轮次',max_revision_rounds:'修订轮次',max_parallel_steps:'并行步骤',max_total_tokens:'Token 总量',max_cost_amount:'费用上限',max_tool_calls:'工具调用上限',currency:'币种'}
let controller=new AbortController(),generation=0
function clear(){controller.abort();controller=new AbortController();generation++;page.value=null;selected.value=null;error.value='';loading.value=false;authorOpen.value=false}
async function openAuthor(){authorOpen.value=true;await nextTick();author.value?.$el.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'})}
function tabKey(event:KeyboardEvent,id:string){const index=tabs.findIndex(item=>item.id===id);const next=event.key==='ArrowRight'?(index+1)%tabs.length:event.key==='ArrowLeft'?(index+tabs.length-1)%tabs.length:event.key==='Home'?0:event.key==='End'?tabs.length-1:null;if(next===null)return;event.preventDefault();tab.value=tabs[next]!.id;void nextTick(()=>document.getElementById('agent-tab-'+tab.value)?.focus())}
function saved(view:AuthorView){selected.value=view;page.value=null}
async function readList(next=false){const session=user.medicalSession;if(!session?.current_context || loading.value || user.medicalWriting || document.hidden)return;const previous=next?page.value:null;if(next && !previous?.next_after)return;const g=generation;loading.value=true;error.value='';try{const result=await listScenarios(session,{limit:20,...(previous?.next_after?{after:previous.next_after,dataset_watermark:previous.dataset_watermark}:{})},previous,controller.signal);if(g===generation && session===user.medicalSession && !document.hidden)page.value=result}catch(e){if(g===generation)error.value=e instanceof Error?e.message:'目录读取失败'}finally{if(g===generation)loading.value=false}}
async function readFixed(id:string){const session=user.medicalSession;if(!session?.current_context || loading.value || user.medicalWriting || document.hidden)return;const g=generation;loading.value=true;selected.value=null;error.value='';try{const view=await readAuthored(session,'Agent',id,controller.signal);if(g===generation && session===user.medicalSession && !document.hidden)selected.value=view}catch(e){if(g===generation)error.value=e instanceof Error?e.message:'该版本不是当前受限流程可读取的模拟 Agent 草稿'}finally{if(g===generation)loading.value=false}}
function visibility(){if(document.hidden)clear()}
watch(()=>user.medicalSession,()=>{const open=authorOpen.value;clear();authorOpen.value=open},{flush:'sync'});document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',visibility);onBeforeUnmount(()=>{clear();document.removeEventListener('visibilitychange',visibility)})
</script>
<style scoped>
.agents-page{padding:28px;color:#243247;background:#F4F6FA;min-height:100%}.breadcrumb{font-size:12px;color:#5C6D82}.page-heading,.heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}.page-heading{margin-bottom:24px}.page-heading h1{font-size:24px;line-height:1.4;margin:8px 0}.page-heading p,p{color:#526279;line-height:1.6}.sections,.tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #DCE3EC;margin:20px 0;overflow:auto}.sections button,.tabs button{border:0;background:transparent;padding:13px 16px;white-space:nowrap;color:#526279;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;border-bottom:3px solid transparent}.sections .active,.tabs .active{color:#1768C4;border-bottom-color:#1768C4;font-weight:600}button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1768C4;outline-offset:3px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE3EC;border-radius:8px;padding:22px;min-width:0}.card h2{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 14px}.summary-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 320px;gap:24px}.role-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin:20px 0}.role-card{border:1px solid #DCE3EC;border-radius:8px;padding:18px;background:#F8FAFC}.role-card h3{font-size:15px;margin-top:0}.checks{padding:0;list-style:none}.checks li{padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E9EDF3;font-size:14px}.checks span{display:block;color:#5C6D82;font-size:12px;margin-top:5px}.notice{padding:12px;background:#EDF4FF;border-radius:6px}.actions{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin:16px 0}.spaced,.selected{margin-top:24px}small{display:block;color:#5C6D82;margin-top:4px}dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:90px 1fr;gap:10px;font-size:14px}dt{color:#5C6D82}dd{margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.limits{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}.limits div{background:#F8FAFC;padding:16px}.limits span,.limits strong{display:block;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.limits strong{margin-top:8px}a{color:#175FAE}@media(max-width:1100px){.summary-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:650px){.agents-page{padding:16px}.role-grid,.limits{grid-template-columns:1fr}.page-heading{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.card{padding:16px}.tabs button{padding:12px}.heading{flex-wrap:wrap}}
</style>
